    "Future landscape design for urban areas should consider incorporating restorative environmental qualities to support human health and wellbeing.",
    "Prioritizing plantings of trees and shrubs can enhance restorative environments by providing homes for birds and wildlife, contributing to positive auditory stimuli.",
