    "Including water features in urban greening can enhance restorative potential.",
    "Creating dynamic balance between different features and materials (soft/hard, varied textures) can promote strength and durability.",
    "Considering the importance of natural sounds over technological sounds in urban greening to enhance restorative potential.",
    "Designing for high coherence in natural settings and high stewardship in managed settings can positively influence landscape perception."
